 to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 弗朗西斯科·莫拉桑省","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%97%E6%9C%97%E8%A5%BF%E6%96%AF%E7%A7%91%C2%B7%E8%8E%AB%E6%8B%89%E6%A1%91%E7%9C%81"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90374260"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q867126"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}}],"cities":[{"id":"city-1159150583","name":"特古西加尔巴","country":"HND","lat":14.10399,"lon":-87.21948,"kind":"city","region":"HN-FM","rank":3,"capital":1,"knowledge":{"theme":"特古西加尔巴 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"像洪都拉斯中部许多地区，全市拥有副热带湿润气候 Cwa，但较高的高度，意味着气温着比下山谷和沿海地区低，平均温度19 °C（66 °F）和23℃（73℉）度之间。","culture":"特古西加尔巴在16世纪建立，当时是作为金、银矿的开采中心，宏都拉斯独立之后，该国的首都在特古西加尔巴和科马亚瓜之间变更了四次，直到1880年以后才固定在此。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q3238","articleTitle":"特古西加尔巴","sourceRevision":94547907,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 特古西加尔巴","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E5%8F%A4%E8%A5%BF%E5%8A%A0%E5%B0%94%E5%B7%B4"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94547907"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3238"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159146345","name":"拉塞瓦","country":"HND","lat":15.76311,"lon":-86.79699,"kind":"city","region":"HN-AT","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"拉塞瓦 · 地点概要","geo":"拉塞瓦（西班牙语：La Ceiba）是洪都拉斯的城市，是阿特兰蒂达省省府所在地，因海港的船坞旧有爪哇木棉（学名：Ceiba）而得名。\n拉塞瓦在香蕉共和国时代曾是洪都拉斯重要的香蕉出口港，现仍为洪都拉斯第二大海港。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q916536","articleTitle":"拉塞瓦","sourceRevision":80690180,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 拉塞瓦","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8B%89%E5%A1%9E%E7%93%A6"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=80690180"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q916536"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159146347","name":"圣佩德罗苏拉","country":"HND","lat":15.50002,"lon":-88.02999,"kind":"city","region":"HN-CR","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"圣佩德罗苏拉 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"圣佩德罗苏拉（西班牙语：，），是洪都拉斯的第二大城市，位于该国西北部，是科尔特斯省首府所在地。\n圣佩德罗苏拉有铁路和公路北通加勒比海沿岸的科尔特斯港。\n拉蒙·比列达·莫拉莱斯国际机场是主要服务圣佩德罗苏拉的国际机场，位于该市东南11公里处的拉利马，以1957年至1963年担任洪都拉斯总统的拉蒙·比列达·莫拉莱斯命名，它是洪都拉斯最主要和最繁忙的机场，2010年约有742,000名乘客。","culture":"圣佩德罗苏拉始建于1536年6月27日，因作为宏都拉斯西、北部地区农产品的集散中心而兴起。\n它最初受益于19世纪70年代和1880年代出口香蕉的增长，并与美国的托运人和铁路企业家的Cuyamel水果公司建立了密切的关系，并在1869年至1874年之间建立了连接该市的铁路。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q274584","articleTitle":"圣佩德罗苏拉","sourceRevision":89059867,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 圣佩德罗苏拉","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E4%BD%A9%E5%BE%B7%E7%BD%97%E8%8B%8F%E6%8B%89"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89059867"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q274584"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159134863","name":"特鲁希略","country":"HND","lat":15.91036,"lon":-85.96001,"kind":"city","region":"HN-CL","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134869","name":"布魯斯拉古納","country":"HND","lat":15.75042,"lon":-84.48,"kind":"city","region":"HN-GD","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134873","name":"伦皮拉港","country":"HND","lat":15.26203,"lon":-83.77164,"kind":"city","region":"HN-GD","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134877","name":"胡蒂卡尔帕","country":"HND","lat":14.67041,"lon":-86.22997,"kind":"city","region":"HN-OL","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134881","name":"科马亚瓜","country":"HND","lat":14.4604,"lon":-87.64998,"kind":"city","region":"HN-CM","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"科马亚瓜 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"科马亚瓜位于特古西加尔巴西北80公里，圣佩德罗苏拉南约77.6英里。\n科马亚瓜位于内地，不会受到海盗的袭击，它的土壤非常丰沃，适宜农业和畜牧业，加上附近拥有产量很高的银矿，因此它的居民增长迅速。","culture":"西班牙人在这里选择了一个没有树木的高地开始建城分地。\n最初在这里建城的人把它的地理位置描写为，离海洋、“尼加拉瓜”的中心和莱昂等距。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q679169","articleTitle":"科马亚瓜","sourceRevision":91698070,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 科马亚瓜","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A7%91%E9%A9%AC%E4%BA%9A%E7%93%9C"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91698070"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q679169"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159134887","name":"乔卢特卡","country":"HND","lat":13.30067,"lon":-87.19081,"kind":"city","region":"HN-CH","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159127151","name":"納考梅","country":"HND","lat":13.52999,"lon":-87.48997,"kind":"city","region":"HN-VA","rank":8,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159127165","name":"科潘省圣罗莎","country":"HND","lat":14.76999,"lon":-88.77999,"kind":"city","region":"HN-CP","rank":8,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159122085","name":"罗阿坦岛","country":"HND","lat":16.33,"lon":-86.519,"kind":"city","region":"HN-IB","rank":9,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"罗阿坦岛 · 地点概要","geo":"罗阿坦岛为洪都拉斯北部海湾群岛中的一座岛屿，为海湾群岛中最大的岛屿。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1419813","articleTitle":"罗阿坦岛","sourceRevision":88115853,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":